# Files the theme deploy leaves out. .github/scripts/create-rsync-filter.sh turns
# each line into an rsync filter rule: a line starting with ! becomes an include,
# a line starting with "P " becomes a protect rule, and any other line becomes an
# exclude. Comments and blank lines are skipped. vendor/ and public/build/ ship.

